# Short reload in game: the FPGA answers as core 0 right after the game
# core with little or no silence, and the firmware must still restart.
# `mode` waits past the new core's first poll, so this exercises the
# game-core-to-0 rule rather than the first-answer rule in g-mode-early.
expect-screen "TangCore"
press down
press down
press down
press down
press b
expect-screen "cgame.sms"
press down
press a
expect-overlay off
expect-core smstang
mode 0
expect-screen "TangCore"
expect-core monitor
